<title>USA: Ascend, Cascade win regulatory okay.</title>
<headline>Ascend, Cascade win regulatory okay.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascend Communications Inc and Cascade Communications Corp on Tuesday said the federal waiting period for their merger has expired clearing the way for them to complete their combination.</p>
<p>The companies expected to consummate their deal merger by June 30, they said in a statement.</p>
